tiful graphs!", "short_description": "Introducing Calcflow, the future of mathematical modeling. \n\n- Experience math like never before\n- Graph your own parameterized functions \n- Unlock your mathematical potential\n\nImmerse yourself in a fun and interactive way to visualize beautiful 3D graphs. Calcflow is great for visual learners to get a better understanding of complex parameterized functions.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nanome.ai/downloads/Nanome-Privacy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nanome.ai/downloads/Nanome-TOS.pdf", "publisher_name": "Nanome Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://nanome.ai/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PRODUCTIVITY", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26549368338088043"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12427653_264639650643827_1112360993104592896_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TESARGGCmn0Q7kNvwG4QFSx&_nc_oc=AdqQcgC8NSBwSXvQ7sXGu-sijU5BL6gDND6cBBeQuly3rQsdbZcWymlY_IZfuSLadRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTNmiN5w8BAge6kjFDLYki34w5QoSGHYbmDI_764ehv2w&oe=6B0B2B1D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Calcflow", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_c